  "content": "<p data-pid=\"aDvhcqQA\">如果这个问题是一百年前提的，那可能还真不容易。</p><p data-pid=\"6JZEPbGS\">砖头厚的日语辞典你总得有吧？日语小说上哪里买去？背单词得自己手写单词卡。想要听日语广播得折腾收音机。日本动漫那更是没得看了。好消息大概是：片假名地狱会少一点。</p><p data-pid=\"2-5W-oj0\">但是现在是 2026 年，电子辞典唾手可得，间隔重复软件到处都是，日漫资源极大丰富，真是个自学日语的好时代。</p><p data-pid=\"onog6o0S\">我从去年 8 月底开始自学日语，到现在也快 13 个月了，日均 2 小时左右，主要就背单词、看番、看轻小说、听有声书（最近开始）：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1462\" data-rawheight=\"1980\" data-original-token=\"v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1462\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1462&#39; height=&#39;1980&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1462\" data-rawheight=\"1980\" data-original-token=\"v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1462\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6c9df973d6fb4bf13da1c709b5574ac4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/><figcaption>codex 根据我电脑上各类日语学习工具的数据制作的</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"ZmX3-poY\">看番学日语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1602\" data-original-token=\"v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2704&#39; height=&#39;1602&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1602\" data-original-token=\"v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-5eb3f94e72df2f98c9b73ac14b710a40_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"xuZZKyDk\">看轻小说学日语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1696\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2704&#39; height=&#39;1696&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1696\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a5090182003a7ebead1cab4a78b4f46d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"jz78cDQE\">听有声书学日语：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1696\" data-original-token=\"v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2704&#39; height=&#39;1696&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1696\" data-original-token=\"v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a2d7f4dd71fe9087d1be2c164a46e186_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ejQlkxf3\">背单词：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1416\" data-original-token=\"v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2704&#39; height=&#39;1416&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2704\" data-rawheight=\"1416\" data-original-token=\"v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2704\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-904b6d6c45848534c17cfdf104e18ecc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"mNY3N2ni\">还有现成的动漫牌组：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.markji.com/deck/6a2a8d6220c7211c3334c9f7\" data-draft-title=\"看动漫学日语：零基础日语听力&amp;语法课程\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">看动漫学日语：零基础日语听力&amp;语法课程</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"TAdBZL0X\">可以说现在就是凭兴趣学日语有史以来最容易的时代。</p><p data-pid=\"02hspV3h\">要找匹配自己目前水平的沉浸材料？可以上 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//jiten.moe/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Jiten</a>：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1832\" data-rawheight=\"1600\" data-original-token=\"v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1832\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1832&#39; height=&#39;1600&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1832\" data-rawheight=\"1600\" data-original-token=\"v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1832\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-8b2eb5c1044df0d6b685a47aa5584ca2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"dd9gYESL\">要边看动画边查词？可以用 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//app.asbplayer.dev/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Asbplayer</a> + <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//yomitan.wiki/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Yomitan</a>。字幕可以在 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//jimaku.cc/\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Jimaku</a> 上找。</p><p data-pid=\"Hw5Bpmj-\">要边读轻小说或有声书边查词？可以用 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//github.com/Manhhao/Hoshi-Reader\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Hoshi Reader</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"4mV9BPwH\">我从今年三月份开始读第一本轻小说，到现在已经读完 19 本，将近两百万字：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2550\" data-rawheight=\"1082\" data-original-token=\"v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2550\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2550&#39; height=&#39;1082&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2550\" data-rawheight=\"1082\" data-original-token=\"v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2550\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ca45c8128616ef63bdfe0a0595440982_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"YoFsqwdq\">动画也看了 48 部：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1796\" data-rawheight=\"2622\" data-original-token=\"v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1796\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1796&#39; height=&#39;2622&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1796\" data-rawheight=\"2622\" data-original-token=\"v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1796\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6ce360eb6158ad0616cfe183dbf7353d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"B9R4rQp4\">今年 7 月也顺便把 N2 给过了：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"804\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;750&#39; height=&#39;804&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"804\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"NgXDUz6a\">这就是兴趣 + 技术的力量。</p><p data-pid=\"SgXrZvhl\">跟别说我去年刚学日语的时候，还是自己在看 TheMoeWay 的面向英文母语者的日语自学教程，现在已经有了更加详细的、面向中文母语者的日语学习指南了：</p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"‌​​​​⁠​‬‬​​‬​​‍﻿​​⁠​​⁠​​‍​‍‌​‬​​‌​﻿‌​​​‌​​​‬‍‌​﻿​基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">‌​​​​⁠​‬‬​​‬​​‍﻿​​⁠​​⁠​​‍​‍‌​‬​​‌​﻿‌​​​‌​​​‬‍‌​﻿​基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档</a><p data-pid=\"YQcMKjP-\">这里还有几篇外国人凭兴趣学会日语的例子，题主若感兴趣，也可以读一读：</p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/43551548/answer/2080009361598984716\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"日语N1如何满分？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8f52847279b5d684c6b9e77d5831dd0b.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">日语N1如何满分？</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2008511709527159502/answer/2079153915543790614\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"我怎么备考日语n1，还是放弃比较好？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d4ed075cfd9503296d2e853218cf0c5f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">我怎么备考日语n1，还是放弃比较好？</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/2001627679498182852/answer/2075973874634712098\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"老外玩成人游戏学日语神速过了二级，这种非传统方法为何有效？\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\"internal\">老外玩成人游戏学日语神速过了二级，这种非传统方法为何有效？</a><p data-pid=\"DVD1tMD8\">Just do it.</p>",
